&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Platform Engineer in our Cloud Foundations team, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in designing, implementing and maintaining our cloud infrastructure on Google Cloud Platform (GCP). You&#39;ll be responsible for ensuring the scalability, security and reliability of our cloud environment, enabling Rightmove to deliver innovative solutions efficiently and cost-effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing scalable, secure cloud infrastructure solutions using GCP services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating, hardening and improving critical Rightmove infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecting, implementing and maintaining infrastructure provisioning and automation through Terraform-based Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and managing container orchestration using Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) and Helm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and configuring key components of our cloud network infrastructure, including CDNs, load balancers, API gateways and service mesh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimising cloud resource utilisation and implementing cost management strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining cloud and network security policies and ensuring compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and maintaining monitoring, logging and observability solutions for our cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting and resolving complex infrastructure issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring junior engineers and contributing to the team&#39;s technical growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-5+ years of experience in cloud infrastructure engineering, with a strong focus on GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Infrastructure as Code, particularly Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in containerisation technologies, including Docker and Kubernetes (GKE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and managing service mesh solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of networking concepts and how to implement them in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GitLab CI/CD pipelines for infrastructure deployment and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language commonly used for infrastructure work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and managing secrets management, telemetry and observability tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to drive DevOps/SRE processes and culture, keeping site reliability and delivery velocity in balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of cloud security best practices and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cost optimisation techniques in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Google Pub/Sub, Kafka and microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance optimisation of search databases (e.g. Elasticsearch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with serverless computing concepts and implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure performance tuning and optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML infrastructure requirements and implementations on GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills and personal qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to collaborate effectively in cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability and an eagerness to learn new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership skills, with the ability to mentor junior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management and prioritisation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and a commitment to delivering high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a talented and passionate Platform Engineer to join our Developer Experience team. As a key member of our Platform Reliability Engineering (PRE) department, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in enhancing our internal developer platform and streamlining workflows for our engineering teams. In this position, you&#39;ll help create and maintain self-service tooling, design standardised workflows and continuously improve the developer experience. Your expertise will help shape our internal platform, empowering developers to work more efficiently and effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining self-service tooling and internal developer platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating and updating comprehensive documentation on platform usage and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing standardised workflows to enhance developer productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing training and support to ensure smooth adoption of platform tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously assessing and improving the developer experience through developer surveys, feedback and metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up and maintaining CI/CD pipeline templates for various project types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams to identify and address pain points in the development process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the maintenance and development of Java-based services and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills, with proficiency in at least one modern programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of Java and its ecosystem, and of the secure software development life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms, preferably Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with container orchestration, particularly Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles and tools, especially Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines and GitOps practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to work collaboratively in a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for improving developer productivity and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Helm for Kubernetes package management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with developer portal solutions such as OpsLevel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the GitLab platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Argo CD for GitOps-based deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of cloud security principles and tools such as Prisma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with contract testing frameworks such as Pact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated testing tools, including Selenium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
