&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at ----- Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verve For Advertisers is a technology company that empowers brands and agencies to target audiences based on declared intent, following them from initial curiosity to ultimate decisioning, to drive measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve unified the company&#39;s demand-side offering under the VFA name, bringing together the largest on-site search-intent dataset outside of walled gardens — built on data partnerships with 3M+ websites, LLM chat signals, and survey data — and premium inventory grounded in our direct SDK integrations. Our technology captures both what consumers do and why they do it, delivering high-fidelity audiences, insights, and outcomes across premium omnichannel inventory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve is building a Brand Direct function — a small, senior team that sells and services select brand accounts directly, alongside our existing agency relationships, rather than replacing them. The goal is to get Verve&#39;s data, formats, and capabilities into brand planning conversations earlier, and to prove that dedicated brand-side support grows accounts faster than agency coverage alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new team and a founding hire. You&#39;ll help define what “brand direct” looks like at Verve in practice, working closely with the Global VP of Brand Partnerships from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Brand Partnerships Director, UK, you&#39;ll own a portfolio of named brand accounts in the UK, working as a generalist across categories rather than a single vertical. This is a senior individual contributor role — not a people-management role in the first instance — designed for someone who wants to build something and has the option to grow into managing a local team as the function scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a hunter first: someone who can open doors at brand (not agency) level, build credibility fast, and turn a first meeting into a durable, revenue-generating relationship. Prior experience or relationships in a specific vertical (e.g. CPG/Retail, Travel, Finance, Beauty/Lux) are a strong plus, as this role has the potential to grow into leading a vertical specialist team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build senior brand relationships — Owning relationships at CMO, Global Head of Media, and VP of Brand level, along with key line-of-business leads such as Data, Creative, and Measurement within the brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get ahead of the brief — Getting into brand planning cycles early so Verve&#39;s data, formats, and capabilities are already part of the conversation before the brief reaches the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Verve in the room — Representing Verve at brand-side (not agency-side) forums, marketing conferences, and roundtables to build Verve&#39;s profile with brand teams directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commission insight work — Working with the insights and data teams to build brand-specific audience stories, category reports, and trend pieces that give brands a reason to meet and stay engaged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure Joint Business Plans — Working towards annual brand frameworks that lock in investment and strategic commitment at brand level, independent of which agency holds the account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the pilot — Building and pitching a defined target list of named accounts, with revenue tracked separately from non-brand-direct-supported business to prove the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell, don&#39;t compete — Partner with the existing agency sales team under a joint commercial framework — this role is additive to agency relationships, not competitive with them; revenue is double-counted so both sides are incentivized to collaborate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are a few indicators that you&#39;re the right person&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of building and owning senior client relationships directly with brands or marketers, not solely through an agency or intermediary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have genuine “hunter” instincts — you&#39;re comfortable prospecting, opening new doors, and creating momentum in a newly-created role with no existing playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an existing network of brand-side contacts in the UK; a specific category or vertical angle (e.g. CPG/Retail, Travel, Finance, Beauty/Lux) is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and building process as you go — this is a Phase 1 hire into a function that will evolve quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong commercial instincts: you can read an account&#39;s growth potential and prioritize your time accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring experience in media, adtech, data, or a related commercial sales environment as helpful context, though the core skill this role requires is brand-side relationship building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with our&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bupa HealthCare Plan&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with easy access to medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Aviva Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;, with Verve contributing 5% of your qualifying earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with a budget of&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;£50/month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;25 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communications regarding your application will only come from ----- or ----- email addresses.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver the power, cooling and capacity that enable Graphcore’s engineers to bring up and test AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Bristol, you’ll lead regional lab and data centre infrastructure delivery and own operational readiness. As Graphcore’s client-side representative, you’ll turn agreed engineering requirements into practical delivery plans and improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will keep existing environments effective while creating capacity for testing and experimentation. You’ll identify constraints before they affect engineering work and improve reliability for high-density AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll guide builds, expansions and upgrades from site assessment through design, installation, commissioning and handover. You’ll manage approved budgets, supplier commitments, schedules and delivery risks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an individual contributor, you’ll use independent technical judgement to balance regional projects with day-to-day operations. Experience with liquid cooling and pressurised infrastructure is particularly relevant to this work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll agree regional priorities with Systems Engineering, hardware engineering, IT, facilities, health and safety, and finance. You’ll coordinate internal teams and suppliers, making readiness, capacity constraints, costs and risks clear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll resolve competing priorities and escalate changes that need additional investment or wider decisions. Working with counterparts in other regions, you’ll share improvements and apply consistent infrastructure standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading client-side infrastructure projects in data centres, labs or mission-critical environments, including hyperscale or high-performance computing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data centre power distribution, cooling, rack infrastructure, connectivity and building requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience guiding projects through design, procurement, construction, commissioning and operational handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret engineering drawings and technical specifications, and assess supplier proposals against agreed requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills covering budgets, schedules, dependencies and risks, alongside infrastructure capacity planning and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across technical and non-technical teams, with experience coordinating suppliers and resolving competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. We also welcome engineers returning to the profession after a career break, including through returnship routes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working:&lt;/strong&gt; Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous leave:&lt;/strong&gt; Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement planning support:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phantom equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peace of mind protection:&lt;/strong&gt; Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Growth at CFO Insights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world’s most demanding investors are busy managing trillions, and ignore anything average. Are you excited by the challenge of making them act?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to work in an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated and extremely driven people? And do you want real ownership from your first week? If so, now is the time to apply for the Growth role at Private Equity Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in sprints and get fast execution under your skin. AI has completely changed the game: You will learn to deploy it to outperform a marketing team of 20+ people, while also learning the fundamentals of copywriting that makes elite investors act, get it to the right investor at a meaningful frequency and deploy what works across every marketing channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career: apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CFO Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is Northern Europe’s largest CFO forum and aims to connect and develop CFOs, finance leaders, and tomorrow&#39;s innovators by addressing the issues of the future CFO. We are connecting more than 11,000 professionals from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited growth potential. &lt;/strong&gt;You will get responsibility before you feel ready. That is how you grow fast. We strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally. You can expect coaching and development from leaders, peers and experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that compound for life.&lt;/strong&gt; Fast execution, copywriting, pricing, conversion optimisation, structured problem solving, and the ability to create impact anywhere in the business at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from the very start.&lt;/strong&gt; You own outcomes, not tasks. We agree the goal, and you find the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be joining our 10+ conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities in this job will vary, however, feed into the mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors. They will be mostly centered around the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the audience.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and convert every fund into our community, and make sure each one receives the right message, at the right time, and never one too many.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own marketing channels that drive revenue. &lt;/strong&gt;Through existing and new marketing channels, you execute activities that ultimately will drive revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write copy that persuades.&lt;/strong&gt; Every email, landing page and post. Become the best copywriter and leverage it at scale with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprint, test, implement.&lt;/strong&gt; Measure the impact of all experiments you run, test offers, copy, prices and pages until the numbers move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build systems, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Anything you do twice becomes a playbook or an AI workflow, so the next win takes less effort than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do whatever it takes to win.&lt;/strong&gt; Some days that means designing an AI workflow. Some days it means checking investors in at the registration desk at 7am. Nobody here is too good for the work that deliver value for investors and fund managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min. a bachelor or master degree with great results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A UK work permit. We do not sponsor visas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic with a sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional drive and desire to be the best at what you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach and sense of ownership/responsibility of everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble approach and share our passion for building companies and developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in continuous learning and proactively searching for ways to optimise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time, in person from our London office (WeWork), 5 days a week. Expect to travel for work about 20 days a year. The start date is flexible.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

